	(gr_text "Areas:\n- Thumbscrew head (round) - do not place LED under this area,\n		LED would be shaded by head of screw\n- Rear Support frame - this area is only on the back side, do not\n		 place components on it, the area is supported by the device frame\n- Fixation groove - this area is on both sides, do not place components\n		 inside it, the area is inserted into the groove that defines the position of the board"
		(at 210 158 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
